	(text "Each collector kicks the opposite base through a 10 uF cap, so Q1/Q2 take turns.\nB1/B2 are joined by net labels (drawn wires would cross).\nPower enters on two separate wire pads (J1, J2): with a 2-pin connector,\n+5V and GND would be forced side by side and this netlist could not be\nrouted on one layer without a jumper or a trace under a part."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60.96 124 0)
		(effects
